# Specialized opcodes — verifies the "GONE" rules from PLAN_v2.1 §2.5/§2.6.
# Tcl 8.6 compiles these to direct opcodes (storeStk, jumpFalse1, etc.)
# rather than dispatching through invokeStk. The walker correctly emits
# nothing for them; their value-handling is the substrate's job.
set x 1
if {$x > 0} { incr x }
incr x 2
return $x
---
